Date: Fri, 28 Aug 2026 07:57:42 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] test: regenerate 12 stale AuthFirst fixtures to the
 LenCap=0x03 wire form
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

All 12 failures shared one root cause: fixtures pinned the pre-bring-up
AuthFirst encoding (Lc=02, LenCap=0x00) while the production code sends the explicit LenCap=0x03 form (Lc=05 + PCDcap2 zeros;
AN12196's own worked examples use LenCap=0x00 — both accepted per issue #3 A/B)
that real NTAG424 hardware requires — proven by every bolty burn/inspect
cycle. Single-form replacement; suite now 313/313 green.
---
 ntag424/src/session/authenticated.rs | 12 ++++++------
 ntag424/src/session/tests.rs         | 12 ++++++------
 2 files changed, 12 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

